debris of the solar system, in the meteorites and asteroids, are the materials needed to drive the

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:20.220
reactors. Yet in their distant silent orbits, these chunks of matter are beyond the reach of

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:28.970
man. Beyond the reach of human hand, but not beyond the reach of the human mind. Driving along a

