00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:53.120
Did you fix the faucet in the upstairs bathroom?

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:56.340
Yes, yesterday, when you asked me.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.440
Vera, I really mustn't stand here talking.

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:10.760
and return these bottles, will you?

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:12.040
They're waiting for me.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.120
Oh, Harold.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.320
Who's you for? An astronaut?

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.230
I've already seen one of their most important men.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.830
He's having me meet with his entire staff.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.360
