00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.130
Close us down? Why, this one project would pay for the entire country.

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:54.680
For defense costs, for schools, for highways, for the whole federal budget.

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:56.320
