00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:41.200
This fragment was found near Redlands, Texas.

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:47.410
The metallic structure has been fused and compressed to a weight of over half a ton.

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:51.330
Finley?

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:36.450
