00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:07.180
like radio waves, television channels, x-rays, and so on.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.790
The entire electromagnetic flux.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:13.180
I have no actual power myself.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:18.960
By using my brain patterns as a sort of focusing device,

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:23.420
I'm able to direct electromagnetic field energy into a discrete beam.

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:28.320
It's rather as though my brain were a lens.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:42.690
light waves into a sharp line. I'd like to see the actual device. The link gate,

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:48.800
amplifier, whatever it is. I'm afraid that's not possible. See, I had to have a

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:57.200
special operation embedded here, directly in the frontal lobe.

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:17.330
embedded in the frontal system below the fissure of rolando six months ago mr finley showed me the

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:25.510
link persuaded me to authorize an extraordinary operation you yeah we knew there'd be risks it's

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:29.390
the toughest decision i ever had to make but i insisted that i really wanted it done

