00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.140
Perfect solution, wouldn't you say?

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.300
Asteroids and meteorites slowed down to boarding speed.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:55.310
Mineral fragments smashed off.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:59.500
All by the concentration of force fields directed by conscious thought.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:02.400
Forget about that cancellation.

