00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:15.810
Tell me, what made you take the chance?

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.780
I mean, why risk your life in a major brain operation?

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:23.720
Well, it's because I wanted to work with you people here on the project.

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:29.960
Where, of course, that the human brain contains more than just scanning waves, axioms, synapses.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:32.610
